I'll help you generate PDFs with Arabic Amiri font using Laravel DomPDF package. Here's a complete implementation:

## 1. Installation

First, install the Laravel DomPDF package:

```bash
composer require barryvdh/laravel-dompdf
```

## 2. Publish Configuration (Optional)

```bash
php artisan vendor:publish --provider="Barryvdh\DomPDF\ServiceProvider"
```

## 3. Download Amiri Font

Download Amiri font files and place them in `storage/fonts/` directory:
- Amiri-Regular.ttf
- Amiri-Bold.ttf
- Amiri-Italic.ttf
- Amiri-BoldItalic.ttf

## 4. Configure DomPDF

Update `config/dompdf.php`:

```php
<?php

return [
    'show_warnings' => false,
    'orientation' => 'portrait',
    'defines' => [
        'font_dir' => storage_path('fonts/'),
        'font_cache' => storage_path('fonts/'),
        'temp_dir' => storage_path('app/dompdf/temp/'),
        'chroot' => realpath(base_path()),
        'enable_font_subsetting' => true,
        'pdf_backend' => 'CPDF',
        'default_media_type' => 'screen',
        'default_paper_size' => 'a4',
        'default_font' => 'amiri',
        'dpi' => 96,
        'enable_php' => false,
        'enable_javascript' => true,
        'enable_remote' => true,
        'font_height_ratio' => 1.1,
        'enable_html5_parser' => true,
    ],
];
```

## 5. Create Font Loading Command

Create a command to register the font:

```bash
php artisan make:command LoadAmiriFont
```

```php
<?php
// app/Console/Commands/LoadAmiriFont.php

namespace App\Console\Commands;

use Illuminate\Console\Command;
use Barryvdh\DomPDF\PDF;
use Exception;

class LoadAmiriFont extends Command
{
    protected $signature = 'pdf:load-amiri-font';
    protected $description = 'Load Amiri font for DomPDF';

    public function handle()
    {
        try {
            // Generate a simple PDF to trigger font loading
            $pdf = app('dompdf.wrapper');
            $pdf->loadHTML('<html><body><p>Test</p></body></html>');
            $pdf->output();

            $this->info('Amiri font loaded successfully!');
        } catch (Exception $e) {
            $this->error('Error loading font: ' . $e->getMessage());
        }
    }
}
```

